  "description": "\"Unique Ability: Resurrection\"\n“What is this? This damn sweet Munchkin skill?”\nBut Kang Hyun didn’t know.\nWhat does it mean to not die, even if you die, even if you want to die…\nA man who became the most notorious hunter on Earth with an immortal body!\nFor the sake of humanity, no, for the sake of humanity’s survival, Today, I alone will be resurrected! \n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
